#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:6
msgid "SDK Directory Structure"
msgstr "SDK 目录结构"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:8
msgid ""
"This document details the directory organization of the UniSDK code "
"repository to help developers quickly locate various resources."
msgstr ""
"本文档详细介绍 UniSDK 代码仓库的目录组织方式，帮助开发者快速定位各类资源。"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:10
msgid "Overall Structure"
msgstr "整体结构"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md
msgid "UniSDK Directory Tree"
msgstr "UniSDK 目录树"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:88
msgid "Key Directory Responsibilities"
msgstr "关键目录职责"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:90
msgid "`api/` — Public API Layer"
msgstr "`api/` — 公共 API 层"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:92
msgid ""
"Provides the most commonly used unified API interfaces for application "
"development. All example applications should be developed using the APIs "
"in `api/`. Main contents include:"
msgstr ""
"提供应用程序开发中最常用的统一 API 接口。所有示例应用程序都应使用 `api/` 中的 API 进行开发。主要内容包括："

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:94
msgid "`tlk_sleep.h` / `tlk_time.h` — Sleep delay and time management"
msgstr "`tlk_sleep.h` / `tlk_time.h` — 睡眠延时和时间管理"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:96
msgid "`core/` — Core Driver Layer"
msgstr "`core/` — 核心驱动层"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:98
msgid "Organized by chip family, includes:"
msgstr "按芯片系列组织，包括："

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:100
msgid ""
"**drivers/** — Peripheral driver implementations (GPIO, UART, I2C, SPI, "
"ADC, DMA, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"**drivers/** — 外设驱动实现（GPIO、UART、I2C、SPI、ADC、DMA 等）"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:101
msgid "**properties/** — YAML-format device property descriptions"
msgstr "**properties/** — YAML 格式的设备属性描述"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:102
msgid "**registers/** — YAML-format register definitions"
msgstr "**registers/** — YAML 格式的寄存器定义"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:103
msgid "**configs/** — Kconfig configuration options"
msgstr "**configs/** — Kconfig 配置选项"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:105
msgid "`soc/` — SoC-Specific Layer"
msgstr "`soc/` — SoC 特定层"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:107
msgid "Contains chip-specific features:"
msgstr "包含芯片特定的功能："

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:109
msgid "**drivers/** — Platform-specific drivers (MSPI, OTP, etc.)"
msgstr "**drivers/** — 平台特定驱动（MSPI、OTP 等）"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:110
msgid ""
"**pinmux/** — Pin multiplexing definitions (yaml files for each package "
"variant)"
msgstr ""
"**pinmux/** — 引脚复用定义（每个封装变体的 yaml 文件）"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:111
msgid "**registers/** — Chip-specific register definitions"
msgstr "**registers/** — 芯片特定的寄存器定义"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:113
msgid "`boards/` — Development Board Configurations"
msgstr "`boards/` — 开发板配置"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:115
msgid ""
"Contains only board-specific pin mapping configurations "
"(`board_pinout.yaml`)."
msgstr ""
"仅包含开发板特定的引脚映射配置（`board_pinout.yaml`）。"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:117
msgid "Code Organization Principles"
msgstr "代码组织原则"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:119
msgid "**Public APIs go in `api/`** — Interfaces shared by all chips"
msgstr "**公共 API 放在 `api/`** — 所有芯片共享的接口"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:120
msgid "**Core drivers go in `core/`** — Peripheral drivers for each chip family"
msgstr "**核心驱动放在 `core/`** — 每个芯片系列的外设驱动"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:121
msgid ""
"**Chip-specific code goes in `soc/`** — Features unique to a particular "
"chip"
msgstr ""
"**芯片特定代码放在 `soc/`** — 特定芯片独有的功能"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:122
msgid ""
"**Application code goes anywhere** — Not limited to the `samples/` "
"directory"
msgstr ""
"**应用代码可放在任何位置** — 不限于 `samples/` 目录"

#: ../../source/developing/directory_structure.md:123
msgid ""
"**Use Kconfig for configuration** — Manage compile-time options with "
"Kconfig"
msgstr ""
"**使用 Kconfig 进行配置** — 通过 Kconfig 管理编译时选项"
